MID_MV14_00: <SH>
MID_MV14_00_m002: No, padre! Vi prego, no!
MID_MV14_00_m003: (inhale/exhale x2)
MID_MV14_00_m004: No!
MID_MV14_00_m005: No! Fermo!
MID_MV14_00_m006: Quello è mio padre!
MID_MV14_00_m007: Nooo! Padre!
MID_MV14_00_m008: (sobbing)
MID_MV14_00_m009: Portatemi la ragazza.
MID_MV14_00_m010: (gasp, followed by panicked/struggling exerts)
MID_MV14_00_m011: Quel volto e quella voce...\nnon li dimenticherò mai. Mai!
MID_MV14_00_m012: Ti ucciderò! Lo giuro!
MID_MV14_00_m013: Ti strapperò il cuore...
MID_MV14_00_m014: e lo donerò al dio dell'oltretomba!
MID_MV14_00_m015: (rushing in to attack)
MID_MV14_00_m016: (attack exert x2)
MID_MV14_00_m017: (damage exert)
MID_MV14_00_m018: (damage exert)
MID_MV14_00_m019: (labored breathing)
MID_MV14_00_m020: (grunt of effort)
MID_MV14_00_m021: Lo scopo della mia vita... sarà vederti morire!
MID_MV14_00_m022: (labored breathing)
MID_MV14_00_m023: (slow exhale)
MID_MV14_00_m024: (slow exhale)
MID_MV14_00_m025: (slow exhale)